1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,048
Three workstreams built one feature from one sentence.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,735
Thirty tests pass. All three are green.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,278
Integration still finds two conflicts.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,719
Each workstream was locally right.

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:19,663
API keys the customer by email. Ledger uses account_id. Notifications never touches it.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,766
COLLIDER checks each collision against the source.

7
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:28,729
Where the brief already decided: AGENT_DRIFT. Where the brief is silent: SPEC_GAP.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,919
The brief names refund_amount, so Ledger is repaired from source.

9
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:39,036
It never names a customer identity. So COLLIDER stops at UNKNOWN, and asks one question.

10
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:43,381
Keeping UNKNOWN is a valid answer. Here, we choose account_id.

11
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,223
That answer compiles.

12
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:53,121
The spec is patched, API and Ledger are repaired, a regression contract is written, and the decision is stored as memory.

13
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,033
Two conflicts become zero.

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,682
A future change puts email back. Tests fail, and decision memory blocks the merge: MERGE_BLOCKED.

15
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:11,112
A wording change to the customer notice touches no decision: MERGE_ALLOWED.

16
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,962
Then Ledger switches to dollars. All 37 tests pass.

17
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,413
COLLIDER still returns DECISION_REQUIRED, because nobody ever decided the money unit.

18
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:27,504
The demo data is preseeded, and labelled that way.

19
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:32,621
Separately, IBM Bob ran the protocol live, with three independent agents.

20
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:39,640
The first replay passed five of seven checks, and we kept that failure. A targeted replay passed seven of seven.

21
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:43,492
COLLIDER is semantic CI for AI agents.

22
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,458
When agents disagree, it finds the decision the specification forgot to make.

